  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">Projecto de Fortalecimento dos Direitos de Propriedade em Timor-Leste (&quot;Ita Nia Rai&quot;)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Property Rights in Timor-Leste Project (&quot;Ita Nia Rai&quot;)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Based upon a request from the Government of Timor-Leste, the USAID Strengthening Property Rights in Timor-Leste Project was developed. Over the past 3 years, Tetra Tech ARD has worked with the National Directorate of Land, Property &amp; Cadastral Services (DNTPSC) to collect approximately 23,000 claims to ownership of land across 10 of Timor-Lestes 13 Districts. The plan is to have 50,000 claims recorded by the end of the Project in 2012.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">Com base num pedido do Governo de Timor-Leste, foi desenvolvido o Projecto de Refor&#xe7;o dos Direitos de Propriedade em Timor-Leste da USAID. Nos &#xfa;ltimos 3 anos, a Tetra Tech ARD trabalhou com a Direc&#xe7;&#xe3;o Nacional de Terras, Propriedades e Servi&#xe7;os Cadastrais (DNTPSC) para recolher aproximadamente 23.000 reivindica&#xe7;&#xf5;es de propriedade de terras em 10 dos 13 distritos de Timor-Leste. O plano &#xe9; ter 50.000 sinistros registrados at&#xe9; o final do Projeto em 2012.</narrative>
  </description>
